flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Show menu]
    B --> C{User choice}
    C -->|Send| D[Validate sender, receiver, payload]
    D --> E[Increment sender clock]
    E --> F[Create message and log SEND]
    C -->|Deliver| G[Find pending message]
    G --> H{FIFO enabled?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Check earlier message on same channel]
    I --> J{Would violate FIFO?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Show error]
    J -->|No| L[Update receiver Lamport clock]
    H -->|No| L
    L --> M[Log RECEIVE and delivery sequence]
    C -->|View log| N[Print chronological event log]
    C -->|Sample| O[Run reproducible scenario]
    C -->|Reset| P[Clear clocks, messages, log]
    K --> B
    F --> B
    M --> B
    N --> B
    O --> B
    P --> B
    C -->|Exit| Q([End])
    C -->|Other| R[Show invalid option]
    R --> B
